      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOT PERFECT (2) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 300m (16.68). Some good form is emerging from his last run. Has ability and can bounce back. APRIL FOOL (8) goes very well over this track and trip including three wins. Recorded a 2 length win (19.37) in a T3 RSTW last time at this track. Looks a key chance on best figures. ASTON BERRY (1) drops in distance on last start and first look at this trip. Should get a good run from the inside box. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. WILD ORANGE (4) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
